          "term": "collective oscillations",
          "heading": false
        }
      ],
      "extract": "Plasmons \\cite{Pines-PhysRev-1953, Pines-Bohm-PhysRev-1952, Ritchie-surface-plasmon} underpin nanosciences \\cite{plasmonics-1} by making possible nanometric energy confinement. Nanometric size of these quasiparticles constituted by collective oscillations of delocalized, conduction band electron gas is realizable only due to the innately quantum nature of the gas which allows ultra-high densities,",
      "extractCut": true
    },
    {
      "id": "sec-002-quantum-framework",
      "number": null,
      "title": "Quantum framework",
      "level": 2,
      "pageStart": 2,
      "pageEnd": 2,
      "labelStart": "2",
      "labelEnd": "2",
      "words": 105,
      "summary": null,
      "keywords": [
