      "extract": "{\\bf Relativistic quantum tunneling:} As the Fermi electron gas gains kinetic energy approaching (and eventually exceeding) the surface potential, the probability of its traversing the material interface through tunneling increases \\cite{Fowler-Nordheim}. The rate of tunneling increases with magnitude of the applied electric field. In our model, electron tunneling which is an ultrafast process with attosecond",
